abstract: "FluvTree is a directed convergent graph framework for river-network evolution: a network substrate and process scheduler, with pluggable long-profile engines run as composable rules on a shared network. It provides an alluvial (transport-limited) engine with gravel- and sand-bed closures and a bedrock (stream-power) engine."
